Here are all six Section 1 tiles. Each one is filtered by $ClaimsApps, so the whole section changes when you pick apps in the variable.

Tile 1.1: Applications in Claims portfolio

Visual: Single value

data record(apmid = array($ClaimsApps))
| fields apps = arraySize(apmid)


Expected: 59 when all apps are selected. If data record fails with the variable, use the variable query itself and replace its last line with | summarize apps = countDistinctExact(apmid).

Tile 1.2: Monitoring coverage quality

Visual: Donut (or bar)

data record(apmid = array($ClaimsApps))
| expand apmid
| lookup [
    fetch dt.entity.host
    | fields id, tags
    | expand tag = tags
    | filter contains(tag, "APMID:")
    | fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
    | summarize hosts = countDistinctExact(id), by:{apmid}
  ], sourceField: apmid, lookupField: apmid, prefix: "h."
| lookup [
    fetch dt.entity.service
    | fields id, tags
    | expand tag = tags
    | filter contains(tag, "APMID:")
    | fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
    | summarize services = countDistinctExact(id), by:{apmid}
  ], sourceField: apmid, lookupField: apmid, prefix: "s."
| fieldsAdd hosts = coalesce(h.hosts, 0), services = coalesce(s.services, 0)
| fieldsAdd coverage = if(services >= 5, "Full stack",
                       else: if(services > 0, "Thin (1-4 services)",
                       else: if(hosts > 0, "Host only - no app visibility",
                       else: "No monitoring data")))
| summarize apps = count(), by:{coverage}


Expected: the four counts add up to 59. These numbers will be different from the earlier 56/14/119 because that split covered all 189 APMIDs.

Tile 1.3: Claims hosts, exclusive vs shared

Visual: Bar, or two single values

fetch dt.entity.host
| fields id, tags
| expand tag = tags
| fieldsAdd lt = lower(tag)
| summarize claimVals = countDistinctExact(if(contains(lt, "portfolio:claims"), tag)),
            otherVals = countDistinctExact(if(contains(lt, "portfolio:") and not(contains(lt, "portfolio:claims")), tag)),
            apmids    = collectDistinct(if(contains(tag, "APMID:"), splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1])),
            by:{id}
| expand apmid = apmids
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| dedup id
| fieldsAdd hostType = if(claimVals > 0 and otherVals == 0, "Claims-exclusive",
                       else: "Shared with other portfolios")
| summarize hosts = count(), by:{hostType}

Tile 1.4: Active Claims problems

Visual: Single value. Thresholds: 0 = green, 1 or more = red.

fetch dt.davis.problems, from:-30d
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter event.status == "ACTIVE" and dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| expand tag = entity_tags
| filter contains(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| summarize activeProblems = countDistinctExact(display_id)

