Tile 1.6: Claims problem trend by impact level

Visual: Bar chart, stacked. Tile timeframe: Last 7 days (set this in the tile settings, not in the query).

fetch dt.davis.problems
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| expand tag = entity_tags
| filter contains(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| dedup display_id
| makeTimeseries problems = count(), by:{dt.davis.impact_level}, time:event.start, interval:1d
